<title>BELGIUM: Sabena, Tyrolean sign code-share deal.</title>
<headline>Sabena, Tyrolean sign code-share deal.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1996-09-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Belgian national airline Sabena said on Wednesday it signed a code-share deal with Tyrolean Airways, the regional subsidiary of Austrian Airlines, for the Brussels-Salzburg-Linz route.</p>
<p>The new link will be operational from October 27.</p>
<p>-- Brussels Newsroom +32 2 287 6815, Fax +32 2 230 7710</p>
